  "description": "Burned out from work, Yeon-Seul’s long-awaited vacation takes a disastrous turn when she finds herself stranded on an island. Her only company? A maddeningly handsome stranger, infuriating as he is irresistible–but with survival forcing them together, sparks fly and an impulsive marriage marked by a night neither can forget transforms their relationship into something rather intimate. But as rescue brings an end to their rendezvous, Yeon-Seul reluctantly resigns herself to the end of her castaway romance–except her island husband doesn’t want to, their love story far from over.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
